                    <signifLet xml:id="m-43056596-d98f-44a2-afcd-abbec87fd2f6" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-c735f71c-8413-494c-8dd7-a838195c2e87" facs="#m-3a96ba13-399a-4c8d-a8fa-b5b28c869efc" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-ea5f2af2-4e96-4edf-9c87-d513db42c232"><lg xml:id="m-1e4069d1-9ba6-4aeb-bd50-6e647a608875"><l xml:id="m-ff6749e5-a0b1-47ae-9be1-35a5b69f7623" facs="#m-d7c3e705-bbdb-4c9b-aa57-75cefa6d2452" label="ambiguous">May 25: St. Madeleine-Sophie Barat</l><l xml:id="m-b7ac095b-28c6-4e2c-9c1e-3b75fedb1947" facs="#m-6bca9488-6a69-4541-8a55-546372973019" label="ambiguous">(45)</l><l xml:id="m-a153899c-7dad-488a-b226-c06b2d74b1da" facs="#m-46b0cad9-3388-4262-99bc-554a663c7000" label="lyrics-like">sapi¬ én¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e7fb4b7-6dc2-48ff-9e9f-e3ccb9db2f49" facs="#m-90929a41-c6e8-40c0-be3e-bf2e68cc5e0e" label="lyrics-like">dá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8ba9b92-d960-47ae-a2b3-9f7a64140c2e" facs="#m-cf892a5c-8887-4c73-bbfc-5a4884e6f826" label="ambiguous">ti¬ am</l><l xml:id="m-0865bd90-1921-4f42-971d-451de278607d" facs="#m-80999141-5cca-4c1c-9770-9a2166a7d90f" label="lyrics-like">bo “gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-b95622c3-bc75-4a83-9d0e-a0c06fe49c79" facs="#m-c23cc70a-1d91-44fb-9c69-9fb34be95ca0" label="ambiguous">ri-am.</l><l xml:id="m-d2d2bfbe-7bad-430e-8553-f95e2defd944" facs="#m-cc122283-6b2d-461d-8476-87aac4edb770" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-71f682c4-c0cb-4e19-9c48-88c83dcedf06" facs="#m-152868ee-5a92-4cc5-8b94-93dc7f4ebbb7" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-d3897940-02e2-4fe6-9cbb-0f66534d775c" facs="#m-16d4b7f2-b696-4f80-8a18-dd1f5d885ff5" label="ambiguous">L-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-751f96d0-f098-457a-801b-cae3d7d71b4c" facs="#m-2ae8c166-a848-403f-ac40-613966ed6712" label="ambiguous">* ij.</l><l xml:id="m-614a1bb9-47b5-4127-b874-aabc3a0f4ed8" facs="#m-e32ebf41-da1a-42aa-b1d6-db8b4cd90f54" label="lyrics-like">lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-d19b4425-b686-4122-a756-aa68d0e90bb0" facs="#m-630ad9f1-06a7-44f4-a370-594ea54dd933" label="ambiguous">V. E- go</l><l xml:id="m-e3afded2-1b2b-40f8-9b80-fd450da23ccd" facs="#m-f4dd1fa6-1f5e-4787-81eb-c42fc7b4eace" label="lyrics-like">tem in Dó-mino gaudé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f4dbbba-b067-4d7a-b0d1-9a71a1ac68a5" facs="#m-673552a6-a866-4a1c-8502-114be8e2c97f" label="ambiguous">bo,</l><l xml:id="m-9ec4dd34-d954-4a6a-8d12-1db11737198d" facs="#m-d6a78baa-3603-48f3-b295-1c1ea41817a7" label="ambiguous">au¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed41758f-d651-4385-bd2c-6e552a9362f0" facs="#m-10adc453-f4f3-4693-b580-1bc55ee8863a" label="ambiguous">et ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7e84bfe-2ae3-4d22-89b1-e465de2a0e3f" facs="#m-c0bd73ee-3c79-4d08-91c8-87801e69a4a8" label="lyrics-like">sultá-bo in Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6dba7597-4530-4468-9df2-ff3300bc403a" facs="#m-6868874d-1f6c-48ff-9838-456855b971c2" label="lyrics-like">Jé-su mé¬ O.</l><l xml:id="m-c396d64c-3e06-494a-a21f-dcf9023e8d12" facs="#m-6a385cc3-5041-453b-b71a-cd32b48a4e37" label="ambiguous">*Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem John 15, 112</l><l xml:id="m-5f2a046e-1061-4c2c-9ca9-ff6d15d02f21" facs="#m-82b08ff6-8c6d-41a4-bb9b-308c7a1254ca" label="lyrics-like">(N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus cólligent eum, et in ignem mit¬</l><l xml:id="m-75a3c656-10ae-4f79-99fc-899ab7170b01" facs="#m-d54fc6aa-8585-497e-b0d8-707e2fafc943" label="lyrics-like">tent, et ardet. Si manséritis in</l><l xml:id="m-da8d7ba5-bcc3-4c52-a5a4-d100db802507" facs="#m-f24d8e94-0696-45ce-89d4-3ca9d5f032fc" label="lyrics-like">L discípulis suis: Ego sum vitis</l><l xml:id="m-ddf1460d-57b1-4447-9d00-8f27555d2471" facs="#m-e21e20ea-9ef3-4709-b5dc-e4df60dbe1f9" label="lyrics-like">me, et verba mea in vobis mán¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3053b50-09aa-44f5-87c5-3538303e8772" facs="#m-0bd6c5ba-c2df-4aad-b28c-fb347c3e7bb1" label="lyrics-like">vera : et Pater meus agrícola est.</l><l xml:id="m-ec868026-ad95-448b-b319-c1fe4658b5e0" facs="#m-0db6dfb8-b2e5-42cc-9086-07037b0c1e4f" label="lyrics-like">serint: quodcúmque voluéritis,</l><l xml:id="m-bf435b8c-cf3d-4a7c-b824-fccf35587c13" facs="#m-834fb09b-5b69-402d-988d-47539e1fbf4e" label="lyrics-like">Omnem pálmitem in me non</l><l xml:id="m-076b0272-43e6-42fb-8440-294b6eefbf5a" facs="#m-a0454e5e-22e5-46b9-9e89-e6a5a3e2455c" label="lyrics-like">petétis, et fiet vobis. In hoc</l><l xml:id="m-490398ab-b941-448e-a16d-6016599d6a77" facs="#m-1b1f426f-9b08-424b-b0d4-304ed7e72787" label="lyrics-like">feréntem fructum, tollet eum</l><l xml:id="m-31fa43aa-df55-4b3d-8808-d38e6638a9bb" facs="#m-0c0aca4c-5587-4d86-9df4-69e92027719a" label="lyrics-like">clarificátus est Pater meus. ut</l><l xml:id="m-8d5a94ca-8494-49af-a400-4cd0a43a886a" facs="#m-ebab78ba-2d33-4369-8363-9ea914c6db40" label="ambiguous">et omnem, qui fert fructum,</l><l xml:id="m-df41893a-929a-4696-b4cb-aafce11228d6" facs="#m-a84275b1-2f1b-4eec-83e8-6abe94ca03ba" label="lyrics-like">fructum plúrimum afferátis, et</l><l xml:id="m-a37f2703-a5e3-4961-bc9e-e38f19980795" facs="#m-5c430cb9-a721-46c1-bfbe-4dae26c87e22" label="lyrics-like">purgábit eum, ut fructum plus</l><l xml:id="m-bc34e9dd-0d0a-410d-83a9-bfb369f3720a" facs="#m-e9500250-cf36-47a0-91e7-4173274e509e" label="lyrics-like">efficiámini mei discípuli. Sicut</l><l xml:id="m-4342098a-96f9-4ae4-96c8-7b450a2cf497" facs="#m-8d6b9bc0-430f-4489-9af2-a5c59d574581" label="ambiguous">afferat. Jam vos mundi estis</l><l xml:id="m-70daa253-e132-478c-ab03-0577f196a2cc" facs="#m-6bbca1f5-2dfc-4152-bfc1-3ed3ba50401b" label="lyrics-like">diléxit me Pater, et ego diléxi</l><l xml:id="m-cc8c88bd-87d7-4358-9549-47a03d2d6c73" facs="#m-d3e67514-ada7-4935-b140-942112615236" label="lyrics-like">propter sermónem, quem locútus</l><l xml:id="m-bd1378cc-9393-401b-a823-596f4241b22d" facs="#m-f9b091d3-01d6-4468-a97b-f76704458558" label="lyrics-like">vos. Manéte in dilectióne mea.</l><l xml:id="m-606aad41-3bc3-47fc-b0d7-715ed7e070f3" facs="#m-6c5c724f-4d1d-4da1-8519-47a7206b0ae7" label="lyrics-like">sum vobis. Manéte in me: et ego</l><l xml:id="m-ec894a4b-60e5-4449-bafd-6395bed8af7a" facs="#m-e2aaf6b4-29ce-4d15-9f48-2101e10a4968" label="lyrics-like">si praecépta mea servavéritis,</l><l xml:id="m-e95a78fd-8021-480e-b560-37942ada5513" facs="#m-5164e1a2-7619-4be4-926e-8a6fa4f788b5" label="ambiguous">in vobis. Sicut palmes non potest</l><l xml:id="m-84a947c7-aec5-4d73-ae5d-1a94accf8e1b" facs="#m-d41801c9-89bd-4f85-b129-6adafbba92f1" label="lyrics-like">manébitis in dilectióne mea, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-c1a7a951-32c7-4dc7-8163-f802da483482" facs="#m-184ae1bb-aa7f-40aa-b775-1b4d5581d945" label="lyrics-like">ferre fructum a semetípso, nisi</l><l xml:id="m-ca3441ad-4e9c-4da0-b16b-15cdbe81d355" facs="#m-685a223e-dfa4-44bb-9c27-bbc78827d30a" label="lyrics-like">mánserit in vite; sic nec vos,</l><l xml:id="m-5d57fffc-fdb6-42c3-9893-e331ea86157b" facs="#m-029316f9-e32c-4e73-b64e-ca288effb1a6" label="lyrics-like">et ego Patris mei praecépta ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-983c05e4-d201-4aa4-bfa9-715820485506" facs="#m-9e1145f0-1520-4fd1-b211-2131a885d399" label="lyrics-like">nisi in me manséritis. Ego sum</l><l xml:id="m-d7e3f6b7-ddec-46c4-9cd2-c4e4d82d9bb0" facs="#m-b3e162c0-0d54-4a2a-b029-5a388edb9975" label="lyrics-like">vávi, et máneo in ejus dilectióne.</l><l xml:id="m-afdfa780-a127-46c1-9bec-01dede37492a" facs="#m-cdb234d3-5ea1-4e61-ba82-6c90e5639b30" label="lyrics-like">vitis, vos pálmites: qui manet</l><l xml:id="m-cbf0a4b1-2043-4c10-b31f-16d4e2d434c1" facs="#m-6ba8b6d6-acf3-4088-a583-1efd1235fda2" label="lyrics-like">Haec locútus sum vobis: ut</l><l xml:id="m-8ebaddd6-2249-46e1-9ec1-5e7740c86bdf" facs="#m-387db978-b35c-4496-85eb-b4a6c84c6463" label="ambiguous">in me, et ego in eo, hic fert</l><l xml:id="m-4af2bb2f-b686-4397-89da-536ad0f5095a" facs="#m-0f2f68ce-856f-44f1-9f70-f928a87f006c" label="lyrics-like">gáudium meum in vobis sit,</l><l xml:id="m-6d05b202-1bae-4c20-9d32-169507fbc93a" facs="#m-082aab27-4058-4c46-b078-384b197aec75" label="lyrics-like">et gáudium vestrum impleátur.</l><l xml:id="m-4c8b741f-ecff-4c11-a3bd-e392997fa44c" facs="#m-6d9df52b-edb0-4ff7-a9d0-6e70a1abfe33" label="ambiguous">fructum multum: quia sine me</l><l xml:id="m-f5761946-53c2-42b8-841e-7ca0a2ea5a45" facs="#m-23e08618-5f4b-48b6-8807-621f68bfcd89" label="lyrics-like">nihil potéstis fácere. Si quis in</l><l xml:id="m-9bb22e32-aa45-4bfd-acc0-2ce8be013656" facs="#m-ece4d146-692c-47f7-8432-b1af95b431ee" label="lyrics-like">Hoc est praecéptum meum ut</l><l xml:id="m-e01dff22-94a6-4982-accb-74409f0ffa3a" facs="#m-245f5800-ed89-4556-ae53-ce2d6631f2f0" label="lyrics-like">me non mánserit: mittétur foras</l><l xml:id="m-1b705248-fcf0-4373-953e-abeaaba5bfd9" facs="#m-f35fbfb9-ee1d-474a-9ec3-2252d77c99fb" label="lyrics-like">diligátis Invicem, sicut diléxi</l><l xml:id="m-a4de2fa9-63ff-45bb-a176-9c2424012961" facs="#m-42965660-606f-49a7-ae6f-d8754fe31d32" label="lyrics-like">sicut palmes, et aréscet, et! vos.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>